 "name_en": "Product Footprint Management (5IM)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Product Footprint Management (5IM)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio8cc26e7de6734fa597410252a92c8201\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio8cc26e7de6734fa597410252a92c8201__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">This scope item enables you to integrate product footprints calculated in SAP Sustainability Footprint Management on SAP Business Technology Platform. Product footprints can be either viewed or integrated into end-to-end processes of <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span>.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio8cc26e7de6734fa597410252a92c8201__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Receive calculated product footprints from SAP Sustainability Footprint Management on SAP Business Technology Platform</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">View product footprints</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Integrate product footprints into end-to-end processes of <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span></li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio8cc26e7de6734fa597410252a92c8201__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Enable the integration with SAP Sustainability Footprint Management in <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span></li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>产品足迹管理 (5IM)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio8cc26e7de6734fa597410252a92c8201\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio8cc26e7de6734fa597410252a92c8201__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">此范围项目使您能够集成在 SAP Business Technology Platform 上的 SAP Sustainability Footprint Management 中计算的产品足迹。可以查看产品足迹或将其集成到 <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> 的端到端流程中。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio8cc26e7de6734fa597410252a92c8201__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">从 SAP Business Technology Platform 上的 SAP Sustainability Footprint Management 接收计算的产品足迹</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">查看产品足迹</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">将产品足迹集成到 <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> 的端到端流程</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio8cc26e7de6734fa597410252a92c8201__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">在 SAP <span class=\"ph pname\">S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> 中启用与 SAP Sustainability Footprint Management 的集成</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
